{"reviews":[{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-0","r":5.0,"t":"Sturdy, Durable, organized Travel Makeup Bag","x":"This makeup bag is perfect for travel.  It has compartments for all the essentials.  Its cute and light.  It's very sturdy and durable.  It is made to protect all the contents inside.","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-1","r":1.0,"t":"Nahhhh too bulky!","x":"I wish I could return it but I think I waited too long! It\u2019s sturdy but my brushes had a hard time fitting in there. It definitely won\u2019t fit in a woman\u2019s suitcase when she has to fly. No place for clothes and this big bulky thing! I\u2019ll find a use for it I guess. Definitely does not work for me!  Revised: the company was so nice to give me a refund and did not ask for the item back. As far as my review...it\u2019s what I thought about the product itself and not the company!  If sturdiness is what you ","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-2","r":5.0,"t":"There\u2019s more space then you would think","x":"It\u2019s amazing for performances if you do shows, dances or anything of that matter, along with moving from home to college. But it\u2019s also just a huge easy way to keep all of your makeup in one place rather then everywhere.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-3","r":5.0,"t":"Made well and great storage","x":"Just enough storage for my makeup to travel. And the dividers can be moved or taken out. Love it!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-4","r":4.0,"t":"Sturdy and roomy except for eyeshadow pallets.","x":"I have a BUNCH of makeup so i was worried it wouldn't all fit however it definitely did! The only reason i gave it 4 stars instead of 5 is because it wasnt big enought for my eyeshadow pallets. They are pretty wide so I should have measured them beforehand. Even so i dont think if they were smaller i would be able to fit more than one. However i am happy with this bag regardless. Very good and sturdy material. I don't regret buying it for sure. :)","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-5","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality & spacious","x":"This product was shipped in a timely manner, made of quality material, and large enough to hold all makeup items and accessories","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-6","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"Canvas on outside very nice case, I wish they gave a couple more dividers otherwise I love it.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-7","r":4.0,"t":"Easy","x":"Only thing I didn\u2019t like about it . Is the dividers were so cheaply made they don\u2019t hold in place long . Other than that I trashed those and use it as it .. it\u2019s amazing good quality for most of it !!!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-8","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"Just what I needed. Portable and sturdy. Great price also.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-9","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"This works great to keep all my makeup and brushes in 1 spot all together where I can control without my daughter getting to it and destroying it. Quality material, and love that the inside is thick walls.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great but small","x":"Bag was well made and clean. Everything was great and sturdy just wish it was larger!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy!","x":"Love love love it. Fits my make up and is nice and compact for travel.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-12","r":5.0,"t":"Best customer service EVER\u203c\ufe0f","x":"I like this for home use, but it is way too big and much too heavy to travel with. Too bad, because the organization is great.  Would like to add I am giving this company five stars for their customer service. They read my review about the bag not being the best fit for me and they offered to send me a new bag or a full refund, which they did follow up on. They also followed up once again to make sure I was satisfied. Cannot say enough about the customer service of Kootek. The person that helped","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-13","r":5.0,"t":"Good Value for the Price","x":"I needed to replace a much more expensive makeup bag that I have been dragging around for years, but I really didn't want to spend a lot of money. This fills the bill. I like the moveable dividers, it's step up actually from my more expensive bag. It seems to keep everything secure, and it is very easy to open and work out of. Haven't had it long enough yet to really rate the durability, but I think I did ok with this choice. I would recommend if you want something that isn't pricey but is still","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great makeup case","x":"It is kind of small but it fits all my makeup I use on a daily basis. Im going to order a large one for my palettes and my other makeup. I do love the sturdiness of it, really helps protect my makeup. I like how I can rearrange the dividers to how I want them, its nice to have a case that organizes my stuff rather than just throwing it into a train case that I was using before and it was always a mess.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-15","r":1.0,"t":"Nice concept, doesn't hold up to regular use","x":"Nice concept, doesn't hold up to regular use. The dividers were great at the start but quickly wore down in less than 6 months of regular use. They wouldn't stay in the slots any longer and thus creating a jumbled mess of all my items.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect Makeup Case - Look no Further!","x":"This case is perfect, with the option to adjust compartment sizes to keep all of your best makeup, brushes and accessories neatly organized and easy to get too. Perfect for at home and on the go - durable and nice looking!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-17","r":4.0,"t":"Very sturdy!","x":"I probably should\u2019ve looked at the specifics better. Very sturdy just not enough separate zipper compartments as I\u2019d hope for.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-18","r":4.0,"t":"Very Very Very Good Quality","x":"I LOVE the durability of it, it is very very sturdy. My only complaint is it is smaller than I expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Love the whole product, i chose a different print, but it is the same product. Love my travel organizer","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect Travel Case","x":"Perfect size. Love the hidden pocket in top & adjustable compartments. Perfect for travel.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-21","r":4.0,"t":"Greatly made but,....","x":"Great quality but needs to be a little deeper. Cant even stand my foundation up inside","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-22","r":3.0,"t":"Make up travel bag","x":"Not real happy had to put in the garage to air it out smells like chemicals","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-23","r":5.0,"t":"I would definitely recommend  it","x":"My grand daughter loves it, she carried it with her all the time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07Z82BJNP-24","r":4.0,"t":"I would buy this again!","x":"Smaller then I expected but still worth the money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the bag as sturdy, well-made, and good quality.","cites":[1,2,4,6,8,9,10,11,15]},{"text":"Many praise its spaciousness and organization, with movable dividers that can be rearranged or removed.","cites":[1,3,4,5,6,10,14,15]},{"text":"Some find it too bulky or heavy for travel, especially for flying.","cites":[2,13]},{"text":"A few note it is smaller than expected or doesn't fit wide eyeshadow palettes.","cites":[5,11,15]},{"text":"Some criticize the dividers as cheaply made or wish for more of them.","cites":[7,8]}]},"qa":[]}